    new milo floppy (it is not hard to figure that out)
  - boot that floppy; you should get MILO> prompt (typing 'help'
    there is not an ureasonable action :-)
  - boot CD from there using a command similar to samples given
    in README on CD; you should be in an installer and in business.
  - with a system installed copy milo, and its loader, from a floppy
    to a FAT partition on a hard disk; set in AlphaBIOS menu entry
    to boot from there and stick your boot commmand (what you type
    in MILO to boot Linux) into OSLOADOPTIONS

