I had the same problem with mouse cursor and ATI Match64 GX 16MB.
After adding line 

Option      "sw_cursor" 

in XF86Config 

...
Section "Device"
    Identifier  "ATI Mach64 GT"
    VendorName  "ATI"
    BoardName   "Mach64 GT "
    VideoRam    16384
    Option      "sw_cursor"
EndSection 
...

it started to work well. May be you forget to launch kdm ?

