If it's the module I think it is..  looking at the cpu card with the fingers
pointing down (into the motherboard, there should be a connector that looks
like a serial port conector near the top, offset slightly to the right.
Below it is a jumper block with 8 pairs of pins.    Jumper row 7 to get
failsafe-loader. row 0 is located closest the connector. Row 7 is closest to
the fingers..

If you can get the model# off the rear of the box (on the serial tag) that
would help.

JJ


