It can be purchased Linux-ready.  Linux-ready is  a specific Hardware
configuration so the system box only contains options supported by Linux
when it leaves MFG.   UNIX/VMS supports many more option than Alpha Linux
(but its changing)  An important one is the Graphics. Only the Elsa is
available in a Line ready box. The Unix TGA's are not supported by Line.

On the install guide web page. if  you look around there's links to the Line
tested hardware list, you can compare it to what's in your system.

JJ
